msgctxt "FrameView|"
msgid ""
"Grabbing failed. This may happen if you try\n"
"to grab from an invalid device. Please check\n"
"your grabber settings in the preferences menu."
msgstr ""
"Snimanje nije uspjelo. To se može dogoditi ako pokušate\n"
"snimati s neispravnog uređaja. Provjerite postavke programa\n"
